  "reason": "The study reports on the development and validation of an in vitro model (HepG2/C3A liver spheroids) for genotoxicity testing. While it mentions 'predictive of human genotoxic exposure' and compares the sensitivity of spheroids to 2D monolayers, it does not report a quantitative measure of agreement between animal model results and human clinical results. The comparison is between different in vitro conditions (spheroids vs. monolayers), not between animal and human data."
